{"id": "t023-002", "text": "Pedro's finally moving to Lisbon, flight's booked for 14 January 2027. He's still looking at flats in Alfama and has two viewings lined up over FaceTime. Chloe's going out with him for the first week. He's selling most of his furniture, so if anyone wants a decent desk let him know. His mum is not thrilled about him leaving but she's planning to visit at Easter.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 January 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewings", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chloe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled about him leaving", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visit", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Easter", "anchor": "e5"}]}
{"id": "t023-003", "text": "Coffee with Ann and Stefan. Ann's knitting a whole blanket for the new grandbaby, she's on square 40 of 64. Stefan's back into chess, plays online every night and is going to a tournament in Leeds on 28/11. Ann reckons he's spending more on chess books than food. Should ask Stefan how Leeds went, he's aiming for a rating of 1800 by summer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandbaby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tournament in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "28/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "chess books", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Stefan how Leeds went", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "aiming for a rating of 1800", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by summer"}]}
{"id": "t023-006", "text": "Wiremu rang. Massive All Blacks fan, already planning to watch the test on 15 Nov at the pub with his cousins. He wants a signed shirt for his 40th, that's 3 Feb, worth remembering.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "All Blacks", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a signed shirt", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 Feb", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t023-013", "text": "Theo's band is playing the Lexington on 21/11, first proper London gig. He's bricking it. Bought two tickets, I'm taking Aidan.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first proper London gig", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bricking it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t023-014", "text": "Oliver's grandad died on the 9th. Funeral got moved, now 19 October was it? no, 19 November. He asked if I could do a reading. Need to tell him yes and ask which poem.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "19 November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell him yes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask which poem", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t023-015", "text": "Kaito moved to Manchester last month, loves it but hasn't made friends yet. Plays in a five a side league Tuesdays. Big City fan which helps. Says the rent is half what he paid in London. His girlfriend Jada is joining him in the new year once her contract ends on 31 December. He's already scoping out gigs at the Albert Hall for them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kaito", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved to Manchester", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hasn't made friends yet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five a side league", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesdays"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "City", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "rent is half what he paid in London", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joining him", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "contract ends", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "31 December", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t023-016", "text": "Adaeze has been crocheting amigurumi for a craft fair on Saturday 7 Nov, she's made like 80 tiny frogs. Buy one or two as stocking fillers, she'd love that.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crocheting amigurumi", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "craft fair", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 7 Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Buy one or two as stocking fillers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t023-019", "text": "Dana's company is closing the Glasgow office, everyone's at risk. Consultation meeting is 4 December. She's really anxious, the mortgage just went up too. Ring her the evening after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "closing the Glasgow office", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at risk", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Consultation meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t023-022", "text": "Yusuf's brother Dawit lost his job at the warehouse, the redundancy came out of nowhere. Yusuf's helping him with his CV. Dawit has an interview on the 18th at the council and is stressed about it. Remind me to message Yusuf on the 18th to wish Dawit luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his job at the warehouse", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t023-023", "text": "Jada's mad into Formula 1 now, knows every driver's tyre strategy. Going to the Abu Dhabi race 6-8 December with her dad, his 60th present. She's never been to a race before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Abu Dhabi race", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6-8 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "60th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t023-024", "text": "Elijah said his nan died peacefully in her sleep on Tuesday. They were really close, she basically raised him. Funeral is Monday 26th of October in Cork. He's flying out with Keisha on the Saturday. Need to send a card to his mum's address, he'll text it to me. Also offered to feed their cat Pepper while they're away, so I need the spare key before Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday 26th of October", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card to his mum's address", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "need the spare key", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t023-026", "text": "Lunch with Mohammed and Pedro. Mohammed's got season tickets for Villa this year and goes to every home game with his son. Pedro's learning the guitar, three months in, can play Wonderwall badly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "season tickets", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Villa", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "guitar", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t023-027", "text": "Ann's husband passed in 2019 and she's still in the same house. She mentioned she might downsize next year, maybe a bungalow near her daughter in Exeter. Nothing decided.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 2019", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "still in the same house", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "downsize", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Exeter", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t023-029", "text": "Stefan's daughter Alina is starting uni in Prague in September 2027, she's been learning Czech on Duolingo. Stefan's nervous about her being so far away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Prague", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Czech", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t023-032", "text": "Joseph says his band are recording an EP in January, three songs. Their drummer Aidan quit, so they're auditioning drummers on the 10th and 17th. Should ask him who they picked.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recording an EP", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "auditioning drummers", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 10th and 17th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him who they picked", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t023-034", "text": "Aarav's had a rough few weeks, he and Lin broke up on 2 October and he's had to move back in with his parents in Slough. He's playing a lot of FIFA. Says he's alright but doesn't sound it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aarav", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough few weeks", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move back in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Slough", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "FIFA", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "alright", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t023-036", "text": "Astrid is training for the Berlin marathon, 21 September 2027. Running 50k a week already. Her husband Oliver Novak thinks she's mad.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21 September 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver Novak", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t023-042", "text": "Dana got a new puppy, a sausage dog called Waffle. Puppy classes start Saturday 14 November. She's already bought it four jumpers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sausage dog called Waffle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Puppy classes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 14 November", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t023-043", "text": "Pedro's dad Mr Costa is retiring on 18 December after thirty years at the post office. There's a do at the Red Lion on the 19th. Pedro asked if I'd chip in for a watch. Remind me to send him £20.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mr Costa", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do at the Red Lion", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him £20", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t023-045", "text": "Teresa said her boss is being awful since the restructure. She's applying elsewhere, has an interview at the BBC on 23 November. Must remember to text her good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the restructure"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying elsewhere", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the BBC", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "23 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t023-048", "text": "Dawit runs a little Ethiopian supper club once a month in his flat, next one is 12/11. He cooks everything himself, doro wat is the speciality. He's vegetarian himself funnily enough.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Ethiopian supper club", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "once a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "12/11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "doro wat", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t023-049", "text": "Jada and Kiara are flat hunting together in Brighton. They've seen one place they loved but the landlord won't take pets and Kiara's got a cat called Mochi. Viewing two more on 9th of Nov. Jada's the one doing all the spreadsheets, Kiara just wants a bath. Their deadline is the end of November because Jada's current lease runs out on 1/12. I said I'd lend them my car for the move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat hunting together in Brighton", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat called Mochi", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Viewing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9th of Nov", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a bath", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lease runs out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "1/12", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t023-054", "text": "Matilda's grandad Uncle Pete, everyone calls him Uncle P, died last Thursday. Funeral is 2 November 2026 at St Mary's. Matilda's doing the eulogy and is dreading it. Remind me to ring her that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Pete", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle P", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eulogy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t023-057", "text": "Alina said her dad Stefan Walsh got made redundant from the bank on Friday. He's putting a brave face on it but she thinks he's gutted. He's got a leaving lunch on 13/11. Should send him a message next week, nothing heavy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan Walsh", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the bank", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting a brave face on it", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving lunch", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "13/11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a message", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t023-058", "text": "Ann and her husband Wiremu are celebrating 25 years on the 3rd of December, small dinner at home. Their daughter Kavya is flying back from Sydney for it. Ann wants to surprise him with a framed photo of their wedding day in 2001, she asked if I could help find a good framer. Wiremu has no idea. Remind me to send her the name of that place on the high street.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25 years", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Sydney", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 2001", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her the name of that place on the high street", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t023-060", "text": "Quick one. Mohammed's son Yusuf passed his driving test this morning, fourth go. Mohammed's thrilled. Also Mohammed's knee is still bad, physio twice a week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "knee is still bad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "physio twice a week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
